/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The user perceives or anticipates a risk and reports the threat through the most secure channel \(button in the app or bracelet, keyword, secure line\) or a trusted contact reports it. In situations of minor or nonexistent risk, they contact AdaLead via its website.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [26]
>>
