519 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (AdaLead confirms service in less than five minutes. The user chooses a communication channel and activates incognito mode on the device. A case manager is assigned, a minimal profile is created with clear consent, and a plan is developed for the next few hours.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
