>>
endobj
521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The user describes what happened, their location, and the type of support they require; defines trusted contacts and privacy levels; and tests a virtual button on their phone or wristband. They receive haptic and visual confirmation, agreed-upon and encrypted safety phrases, and offline verification of the delivery.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
