<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The user completes a 5-minute simulation, sets up check-ins and geofences, validates routes, and collects the wristband if applicable. Alerts are delivered to the trusted network even without internet access, with manager support, escalation if the risk increases, and encrypted evidence available.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
